					"id": 740841101,
					"content": "…あ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841102,
					"content": "なんでメリュジーヌが？おい！早くヴィシャップから離れろ、危ないぞ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841103,
					"content": "突然現れたメリュジーヌはヴィシャップの頭を撫で、暴怒のヴィシャップが大人しく俯いた。\\nそして口を開け、キラキラ光る雫を吐き出し、そのまま水中に飛び込んだ。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841104
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841104,
					"content": "え？どういうことだ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841105,
					"content": "鍵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841106,
					"content": "え…なにが鍵なんだ？この雫が鍵なのか？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841107,
					"content": "パシーフ。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841108,
					"content": "えっと…この雫がパシーフ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841109,
					"content": "メリュジーヌ。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841110,
					"content": "えぇ？どういうことだよ？この雫がメリュジーヌ？頭がくらくらしてきたぞ、一体なんなんだ？おまえこそメリュジーヌだろ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841111,
					"content": "パシーフ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841112,
					"content": "ん…？おまえがパシーフ？それは名前か？それとも苗字？…聞いたらますますくらくらしてきたぞ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841113,
					"content": "よし！おまえをパシーフって呼ぶ！これでいいか？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841114,
					"content": "メリュジーヌ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841115,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}…どうしよう？こいつがなにを言いたいのか全然わからないぞ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841116,
					"content": "#{M#俺}{F#私}たちの言葉は分かるんだよね？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841117
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841117,
					"content": "パシーフ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841118,
					"content": "この雫が鍵なんだよね？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841119
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841119,
					"content": "パシーフ。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841120,
					"content": "#{M#君}{F#あなた}は人間じゃない、でしょ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841121
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841121,
					"content": "パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841122,
					"content": "おい…そんなの見ればわかるだろ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841123,
					"content": "#{M#俺}{F#私}は人間じゃない、でしょ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841124
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841124,
					"content": "メ…メリュジーヌ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841125
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841125,
					"content": "あ！待て、ちょっとわかったぞ…「パシーフ」がはい、「メリュジーヌ」がいいえって意味じゃないか？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841126
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841126,
					"content": "パシーフ！パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841127
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740820737,
					"content": "パシーフ！パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740820738
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841127,
					"content": "パシーフっておまえの名前じゃなかったのか…ごめんな、間違えちゃって。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841128
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841128,
					"content": "パシーフ…好き…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841129
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841129,
					"content": "この名前が気に入ったの？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841130
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841130,
					"content": "パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841131
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841131,
					"content": "#よかった！じゃあおまえの名前はそれで決まりだ！へへ、はじめまして！オイラはパイモン。こっちは{NICKNAME}！さっきはヴィシャップを追い払ってくれてありがとな。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841132
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841132,
					"content": "青いやつ、いいもの、鍵、守る。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841133
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841133,
					"content": "青いやつって、さっきのヴィシャップ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841134
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841134,
					"content": "パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841135
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841135,
					"content": "もしかしてあいつは鍵を守ってくれてたのか？おまえ、あのヴィシャップと友達か？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841136
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841136,
					"content": "パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841137
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841137,
					"content": "紫のやつ、鍵奪う…青いやつ、倒れた…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841138
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841138,
					"content": "む、紫のやつ？それって誰だ？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841139
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841139,
					"content": "#紫のやつ、わるいもの！青いやつ、パイモン、{NICKNAME}、いいもの！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841140
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841140,
					"content": "うーん…まぁいいか…オイラたちを褒めてるみたいだけど、なんかおかしいような…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841141
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841141,
					"content": "紫のやつ、すごい悪い、エリニュス、メリュジーヌ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841142
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841142,
					"content": "エリニュス、メリュジーヌ？エリニュスがいいえ？うーん…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841143
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841143,
					"content": "エリニュス島は良くないの？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841144
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841144,
					"content": "エリニュス、メリュジーヌ、今…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841145
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841145,
					"content": "パシーフ、エリニュス、守る…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841146
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841146,
					"content": "エリニュス島がまずいことになってるから、守りたいのか？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841147
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841147,
					"content": "#パイモン、{NICKNAME}、エリニュス、手、おてて…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841148
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841148,
					"content": "#うーん…おてて？えっと…{NICKNAME}とオイラが手を繋いでエリニュス島を周るってことか？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841149
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841149,
					"content": "メリュジーヌ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841150
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841150,
					"content": "#{M#俺}{F#私}たちの手を借りたいの？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841151
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841151,
					"content": "パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841152
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841152,
					"content": "協力してほしいってことか…手を繋ぐのかと思ってたぜ…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841153
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841153,
					"content": "手、おてて…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841154,
						740841158
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841154,
					"content": "報酬はある？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841155
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841158,
					"content": "助けるってどうやって？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841159
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841155,
					"content": "ホウ…シュウ…？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841156
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841156,
					"content": "#まったく、{NICKNAME}。こいつってあんまり話せないだろ、だからきっと他のやつに助けを求めたりするのができないと思うぞ。オイラたちが助けてやろうぜ。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841157
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841157,
					"content": "助けるってどうやって？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841159
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841159,
					"content": "鍵、鍵、鍵、数。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841160
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841160,
					"content": "それで？鍵の数は？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841161
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841161,
					"content": "鍵！鍵！鍵！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841162
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841162,
					"content": "鍵は三本？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841163
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841163,
					"content": "パシーフ！鍵、霧…道、南…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841164
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841164,
					"content": "鍵、泉、北…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841165
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841165,
					"content": "鍵、柳、東…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841166
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841166,
					"content": "おお！なるほど…ひとまず覚えておくか…鍵は全部で三本、南の霧の道、北の泉、東の柳…ってことだよな？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841167
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841167,
					"content": "鍵、鍵、鍵、広場、西。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841168
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841168,
					"content": "西の広場にはさらに鍵が三本あるって？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841169
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841169,
					"content": "鍵を三本集めて広場に行くってこと？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841170
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 740841170,
					"content": "#パイモン、メリュジーヌ！{NICKNAME}、パシーフ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841171
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841171,
					"content": "#あっ、パシーフ！{NICKNAME}がオイラより賢いみたいに言わなくてもいいじゃんか！オイラはこいつと同じくらい賢いぞ！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841172
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841172,
					"content": "とにかく、オイラたちは鍵を一本手に入れたんだ、あと二本取ってくればいいんだよな。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841173
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841173,
					"content": "エリニュス、メリュジーヌ…パシーフ、守る！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841174
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パシーフ"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841174,
					"content": "安心しろ。何が起きたかわかんないけど、エリニュス島はオイラたちが守ってやるからな。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841175
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841175,
					"content": "でも一つだけ…パシーフ、誰の物じゃない金ピカでまん丸の物、それかひと目見て高そうな箱があったら…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						740841176
					],
					"speakerTitle": "パイモン"
				},
				{
					"id": 740841176,
